<BaseLayout title="About KRIYANO | Practical AI for Work & Creators" description="Learn how KRIYANO helps people use AI for work and content creation through practical prompts, tools and responsible review.">
 <div class="container kit-page"><header class="kit-heading"><div class="section-kicker">About KRIYANO</div><h1>Practical AI.<br/>With human judgment.</h1><p>KRIYANO helps knowledge workers, small-business teams and creators use AI more effectively: prepare a clear brief, create a useful draft and review the result.</p></header>
 <article class="kit-reading"><h2>Create, check and improve</h2><p>Our focus is practical AI for work and content creation. Prompt Builder helps structure instructions; the Prompt Library adds task-specific examples; CHECK highlights information that needs verification. Our supporting office and business utilities remain available.</p><p>The idea behind the name comes from “Kriya”, or action. The goal is a result you can use in your work.</p>
 <h2>Know what a tool does</h2><p>Each tool explains its inputs, output and limitations. Prompt Builder helps you specify the task, context and output. CHECK separates local signals from optional AI review. Our guides explain how to assess the answer against your evidence.</p>
 <h2>Clear about your data</h2><p>The List Cleaner, Margin &amp; Markup Calculator, Quotation Builder and Prompt Builder process inputs in your browser. They do not upload those inputs. KRIYANO CHECK offers browser-based signals and an optional online AI review; that review sends the entered text for processing. See the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for details.</p>
 <h2>AI assists; you review</h2><p>Prompts and AI reviews are starting points. CHECK highlights information to investigate; it does not certify truth, independently verify sources or guarantee complete error detection. Important decisions still need your own evidence and judgment.</p>
 <h2>How tools are checked</h2><p>The office and business tools include worked examples and automated checks for calculations and edge cases, including duplicate codes, zero values, invalid targets and quotation rounding. Examples are illustrative, not customer testimonials. If you find an error, please report the tool name, steps and a non-sensitive example.</p>
 <h2>Help shape what comes next</h2><p>Useful improvements start with a real task. Send a suggestion or correction to <a href="mailto:contact@kriyano.com">contact@kriyano.com</a>. Please avoid sending confidential records or customer data.</p><div class="kit-actions"><a class="kit-btn primary" href="/tools/">Explore the tools →</a><a class="kit-btn" href="/contact/">Suggest an improvement</a></div></article></div>
</BaseLayout>
